🎟️ Local Events Calendar – EventHub

A full-stack web application designed to help communities discover, organize, manage, and participate in local events.

📌 Project Overview

Local Events Calendar (EventHub) is an event management platform that connects event organizers with attendees. It provides event discovery, calendar views, registration, digital tickets, and event administration through a user-friendly interface.

✨ Key Features

- Event Discovery: Browse and search for upcoming local events.
- Interactive Calendar: View events through calendar layouts.
- User Authentication: Secure login and registration.
- Role-Based Access: Separate access for administrators, organizers, and attendees.
- Event Management: Create, update, publish, and manage events.
- QR Code Ticketing: Generate digital event tickets.
- Attendance Management: Scan tickets and manage event check-ins.
- Waitlist Management: Handle registrations when events reach capacity.
- Notifications: Automated event reminders.
- Personalized Recommendations: Discover events based on interests and preferences.
- Admin Dashboard: Manage users, events, and platform activities.

🛠️ Technologies Used

Category| Technology
Frontend| React.js
Build Tool| Vite
Styling| Tailwind CSS
Backend| Node.js, Express.js
Database| PostgreSQL
ORM| Prisma
Authentication| JWT, bcryptjs
Calendar| FullCalendar
Charts| Recharts
Testing| Vitest, Playwright

